    "sections": {
        "description": "The Finance Accountant theme provides a structured and responsive layout designed for presenting financial information, services, reports, and business content in an organized manner. It includes customizable homepage sections, content blocks, banner areas, and navigation menus that help arrange information clearly across different devices. The theme supports flexible typography and color settings, allowing visual adjustments through built-in customization options without modifying core files. Additional features include blog integration, contact forms, service sections, image galleries, social media links, and widget-ready areas that extend functionality. Multiple page templates help organize content such as financial reports, company information, service details, and informational resources. The responsive design ensures content adapts smoothly to desktops, tablets, and smartphones while maintaining readability and usability. Search functionality and customizable footer areas further improve content accessibility. The layout emphasizes organized spacing, clear navigation, and structured content presentation. Compatibility with modern browsers and commonly used plugins provides flexibility for future enhancements. Overall, the theme offers a practical framework for displaying information, updates, and services while maintaining a consistent appearance across various screen sizes and devices."
    },
